      "y": 680,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "LangChain 统一抽象 · 反射动态加载\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  OpenAI (GPT-4/5)   │  Anthropic (Claude)\n  DeepSeek            │  Google Gemini\n  字节豆包 Volcengine  │  Moonshot Kimi\n  MiniMax             │  Novita AI\n  OpenRouter          │  Codex CLI\n  Claude Code         │  自定义兼容接口",
