      "text": "MessageBus (异步 Pub/Sub) → Manager → Store\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n Telegram (Bot API long-polling) → runs.wait()\n Slack (Socket Mode)             → runs.wait()\n Feishu/Lark (WebSocket)         → runs.stream()",
